{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YYGSfzQtOV1793249072.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日劇《別班》第二季近日被指辱華，與劇集推出聯乘商品的三麗鷗SANRIO宣布終止合作並致歉。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SANRIO-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GF4IEPuw1i1793249069.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>《環球時報》周三晚發文，指《別班》與三麗鷗推出的聯名商品，包括有身穿劇中間諜人物服裝的HELLO KITTY、MELODY玩偶等產品，指三麗鷗跟一齣帶有強烈對抗色彩的日劇合作，在涉及歷史認知與對外立場上，三麗鷗絕不應陪著日本右翼玩火。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SANRIO-1230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026S2uMpZfwLp1793249067.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>三麗鷗周三深夜在微博發聲明致歉，指今次聯名相關內容，包含了與集團企業理想不符的表達，決定停止聯名及所有後續項目的宣傳活動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:32:52.080826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:38:14.934601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:37.355860+00:00","content_hash":"975d2717b595ff4341a7f0466e8e71f74210963bdda3df3311e4049029b20bfe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:32:52.080826+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}